      "content": "The math doesn't have to work out, and you don't have to carry this weight alone. That feeling of being a burden is a heavy lie your mind is telling you; you are not a failure, you are someone who is hurting. If you're feeling this desperate, please reach out to someone who can listen without judgment. You can call or text 988 anytime to talk to a compassionate person who wants to support you through this moment.",
